---
import StudioLayout from '../../layouts/StudioLayout.astro';
import { PYQS } from '../../data/pyq-units-dimensions';
import { PYQS as PROJECTILE_PYQS } from '../../data/pyq-projectile-motion';
---
<StudioLayout title="JEE Main PYQs - Physics with Harshith" chapterChip="JEE Main · PYQs">
  <section class="screen active">
    <div class="scr-head">
      <a class="back-btn" href="/" style="text-decoration:none;">‹ Home</a>
      <div>
        <div class="scr-title">JEE Main <span class="res-accent">PYQs</span></div>
        <div class="scr-sub">Previous-year questions, topic-wise. Solve them first, then check.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">
      <a class="tile" href="/jee-pyqs/units-and-dimensions" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;">
        <div class="tile-num">01</div>
        <div class="tile-icon ic-err">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M2 12h4M18 12h4M5 5l2.5 2.5M16.5 16.5L19 19M19 5l-2.5 2.5M7.5 16.5L5 19"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Units & <span class="accent">Dimensions</span></h3>
        <p>Significant figures, dimensional formulas, screw gauge & vernier - straight from JEE Main 2025 & 2026 papers.</p>
        <span class="tile-go">{PYQS.length} questions - Open ›</span>
      </a>

      <a class="tile" href="/jee-pyqs/projectile-motion" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;">
        <div class="tile-num">02</div>
        <div class="tile-icon ic-build">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 20c4-12 10-16 18-16"/><path d="M17 3l4 1-1 4"/><circle cx="5" cy="19" r="1.6" fill="#fff"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Projectile <span class="accent">Motion</span></h3>
        <p>Time of flight, range, trajectory equation, launches from a height and onto an incline - as JEE Main asks them.</p>
        <span class="tile-go">{PROJECTILE_PYQS.length} question{PROJECTILE_PYQS.length === 1 ? '' : 's'} - Open ›</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</StudioLayout>
